<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">02062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Russia struck Kyiv, Dnipro and Kharkiv overnight with ballistic missiles and drones, killing at least four people, among them a seventy-three-year-old woman in Dnipro.</s> <s>A twenty-four-storey apartment block in Kyiv collapsed under a direct hit, and the targeting of homes and a children's playground shows how routine the bombardment of cities has become as this war grinds into its attritional phase.</s> <s>Where the BBC counts the civilian dead, Russian state media counts only military targets... and that gap is itself part of the war.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Damascus, eighteen months after Bashar al-Assad's fall, Syria's new ministries and security posts are filling with fighters from Halfaya and the towns of rural Idlib.</s> <s>These were the heartlands of the armed revolution, and their rise displaces the Alawite patronage network of Qardaha that sustained the old regime — post-war states tend to reconstitute power around the geography of whoever won.</s> <s>Whether that broadens Syrian power or simply relocates the patronage from one region to another is the question now hanging over the new order.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Punjab Police told the Lahore High Court that around eighty percent of the girls recovered from missing-persons cases since twenty twenty-one had contracted marriages of their own choosing.</s> <s>The claim became grounds to drop kidnapping charges, yet it sidesteps Pakistan's most contested line — where free consent ends and coercion or forced conversion begins.</s> <s>The court has ordered a progress report by the eighteenth of June, with one thousand eight hundred and fifty-three of three thousand two hundred and fifty-eight reported-missing girls still unaccounted for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel declared forty kilometres of southern Lebanon a combat zone and pushed ground troops deeper than at any point in twenty-six years, emptying the Beirut suburbs of Dahieh that had only just reopened.</s> <s>Behind the scenes, President Trump reportedly told Prime Minister Netanyahu that bombing Beirut would leave him isolated, even invoking prison — a patron openly restraining its client.</s> <s>Iran has suspended its nuclear talks with Washington until the offensive stops, so a single phone call may now be all that stands between this and a wider war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Manila, senators opened the impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Duterte, where a conviction would bar her from public office for life.</s> <s>President Marcos's bloc is using the proceedings to blunt her expected twenty twenty-eight presidential bid, the latest turn in a feud between two dynasties that once ruled in alliance.</s> <s>Acquittal would reset her as the leading challenger... so the trial is as much about the next election as the last one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ghana has evacuated three hundred of its citizens from South Africa and suspended travel there, after vigilante groups attacked foreign nationals and seized their businesses.</s> <s>It's the first African government to repatriate its people over the xenophobic violence that has flared repeatedly across South Africa since the two thousand eights.</s> <s>Other West African states are now weighing their own evacuations, a sign of how far trust between African nations has frayed.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China's <sub alias="S A I C">SAIC</sub> Motor has chosen the Spanish port town of Ferrol to build cars inside the European Union, turning the bloc's electric-vehicle tariffs into a reason to manufacture locally.</s> <s>The two-hundred-million-euro plant would create a thousand jobs and convert a trade barrier into a domestic-production exemption — the classic move of a carmaker leaping a tariff wall, much as Japanese firms once did in America.</s> <s>Madrid's foreign-investment approval still stands between the plan and the factory floor.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria's Cross River State, a survey found that almost nine in ten residents intend to leave.</s> <s>The pollster <sub alias="S B M">SBM</sub> Intelligence reported the state ranked last in eleven of fifteen quality-of-life measures, citing failed roads, healthcare and electricity.</s> <s>It warned of a looming demographic collapse if the exodus holds — a quiet kind of crisis that rarely makes headlines until the people are already gone.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Berlin, researchers at the Charité are engineering bacteria to build the base chemicals behind nearly every plastic, medicine and cosmetic from methanol instead of fossil oil.</s> <s>Almost the entire chemical industry begins with petrochemicals, so swapping the feedstock itself attacks emissions at the root rather than merely cleaning the factory's power supply.</s> <s>The project, called CarboNcare, has yet to match fossil yields... but decarbonising the raw material, not just the energy, is the harder and more lasting problem.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Hong Kong team has developed a way to edit RNA, the body's temporary genetic messenger, without ever touching the DNA itself.</s> <s>Because the RNA message fades, the edit is reversible — a fundamentally different safety class from CRISPR, which rewrites the genome permanently.</s> <s>The technique targets neurodegenerative disease, where a permanent gene edit would be too risky to attempt.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers at the Indian Institute of Technology Delhi found that air pollution's health toll falls along India's caste lines.</s> <s>The same dose of fine particulate matter causes more disease among the poorest, because weaker baseline health amplifies an identical exposure.</s> <s>The team argues that aiming clean-air efforts at these communities would save the most lives for every rupee spent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Near Paris, sterilised soil zapped with gamma radiation kept running self-sustaining chemical cycles for six years, with nothing alive inside it.</s> <s>That result strengthens the metabolism-first theory of life's origin — the idea that self-sustaining chemical cycles came before genes and cells, not after.</s> <s>Whether those bare reactions could ever have crossed the line into life is the experiment the team is still running.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Amazon has shut down an internal leaderboard ranking employees by their use of artificial-intelligence tools, after staff admitted they had gamed it.</s> <s>Workers flagged for insufficient AI use simply scripted pointless prompts to climb the rankings — a textbook case of Goodhart's law, where a measure stops measuring anything once it becomes a target.</s> <s>It's a cautionary tale from inside one of the companies building these models, about how little any leaderboard, internal or public, really tells you.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States immigration agency, <sub alias="I.C.E.">ICE</sub>, paid two million dollars for spyware able to read Signal and WhatsApp messages remotely, then released the contract with seventy-seven pages blacked out.</s> <s>Nearly six hundred more pages remain hidden, and the vendor, Paragon, advertises that buyers can deploy its tool with no trace left on the target's phone.</s> <s>What an agency redacts often reveals more than what it discloses... and here almost everything is redacted.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>